{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "c2f3a4b5-d6e7-4f80-9a1b-2c3d4e5f6071",
		"name": "Provider Transformer - Sabre Connector",
		"description": "Test collection for the Sabre provider-transformer service (FastAPI + msgspec).\n\n1. Start the server:\n   ./env/Scripts/python -m uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8090\n2. Run requests in this collection.\n\nORBiS connector contract (Java calls this):\n- POST /api/flights/search : common payload -> Sabre BFM request -> raw BFM response\n\nTransform endpoints (bare home payloads, Sabre only):\n- POST /transform/{provider}          : home payload -> Sabre BFM request\n- POST /transform/{provider}/response : Sabre BFM response -> HOME RESPONSE\n- GET  /providers                     : registered providers\n- GET  /health                        : health check\n\nThe home response is the same shape the Akasa connector produces, so the frontend\nreceives one structure from every provider.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "http://127.0.0.1:8090",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "sabre_engine_url",
			"value": "https://api.cert.platform.sabre.com/v5/offers/shop",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
